        "id": 17618,
        "title": "Roles",
        "type": "practiceLevel1",
        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 149427,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Now that you know the basics of game UI accessibility, let's learn about accessibility standards.</p><p><code>WAI-ARIA</code> stands for <em>Web Accessibility Initiative-Accessible Rich Internet Applications</em> and it's a specification for accessibility standards.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 149428,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Standards help players access game menus and HUDs. Semantics is an important accessibility standard.</p><p>Sometimes we cannot use the HTML tags we want. Learn what to do in those cases.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 149429,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Semantic HTML tags (like <code>button</code> and <code>li</code>) help screen readers. But some game UI uses generic elements like <code>div</code>.</p><p>To improve accessibility, add a <code>role</code> attribute with an empty value.</p><code name=\"index.html\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"38\" endIndex=\"42\" /><option startIndex=\"42\" endIndex=\"43\" /><option startIndex=\"43\" endIndex=\"45\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"&lt;!doctype html&gt;\" class=\"meta\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"div\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"role\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Start Game\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"div\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>role</code>, followed by <code>=</code>, and finally <code>\"\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 149430,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Role attributes provide meaning to the assistive technologies but don't change anything visually.</p><p>They help attach meaning to elements, like this <code>\"banner\"</code> role that tells the screen reader it is the header of the page.</p><code name=\"index.html\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"38\" endIndex=\"42\" /><option startIndex=\"44\" endIndex=\"50\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"&lt;!doctype html&gt;\" class=\"meta\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"div\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"role\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;banner&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"   \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"img\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"src\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;https://mimo.app/i/bug.png&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"alt\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;game logo&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"   \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Dungeon Dash\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"   \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"h2\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Press Start to play\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"h2\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"div\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>role</code>, followed by <code>banner</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 149431,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>role</code> also helps assistive technologies to identify blocks that need to be considered as a single block.</p><p>If we want screen readers to identify these sprites as a single image, we can assign the <code>\"img\"</code> role to the container.</p><code name=\"index.html\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"5\" endIndex=\"9\" /><option startIndex=\"9\" endIndex=\"10\" /><option startIndex=\"10\" endIndex=\"15\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"div\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"role\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;img&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"img\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"src\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;player.png&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"alt\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"img\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"src\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;sword.png&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"div\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>role</code>, followed by <code>=</code>, and finally <code>\"img\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6",
            "id": 149432,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>The <code>comment</code> role implies a reaction to some content. Add this role to the <code>div</code> element to turn the playtester's feedback into a comment.</p><code name=\"index.html\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"44\" endIndex=\"51\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"&lt;!doctype html&gt;\" class=\"meta\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"div\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"role\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;comment&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"   \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"h3\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Playtester said\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"h3\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"   \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"The boss fight feels too hard at level 1.\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"   \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"March 21 2019, 11:30\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"div\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to type <code>comment</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #7",
            "id": 149433,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>The <code>\"contentinfo\"</code> role indicates that there's a footer at the end of the page. It contains copyright, contact, or privacy information.<br /></p><code name=\"index.html\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"38\" endIndex=\"42\" /><option startIndex=\"42\" endIndex=\"43\" /><option startIndex=\"43\" endIndex=\"56\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"&lt;!doctype html&gt;\" class=\"meta\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"div\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"role\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;contentinfo&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"© 2026 Dungeon Dash Studio.\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"div\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>role</code>, followed by <code>=</code>, and finally <code>\"contentinfo\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #8",
            "id": 149434,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Additionally, roles can provide further information. The <code>\"alert\"</code> role warns users about events or changes in content. Add it to the <code>div</code> element.</p><code name=\"index.html\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"38\" endIndex=\"42\" /><option startIndex=\"42\" endIndex=\"43\" /><option startIndex=\"43\" endIndex=\"50\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"&lt;!doctype html&gt;\" class=\"meta\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"div\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"role\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;alert&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Health low! Find a potion.\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"div\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>role</code>, followed by <code>=</code>, and finally <code>\"alert\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #9",
            "id": 149435,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>What's the purpose of WAI-ARIA?<br /></p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">To ensure websites meet accessibility standards</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">To use semantic tags</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">To ensure websites meet accessibility standards.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #10",
            "id": 149436,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>What changes can assistive technologies detect in an element with an <code>alert</code> role?<br /></p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Changes in the content</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Changes in the page structure</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Changes in the content.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #11",
            "id": 149437,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>What kind of information do assistive technologies expect with this role?<br /></p><code name=\"index.html\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\"><content><text value=\"&lt;!doctype html&gt;\" class=\"meta\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"div\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"role\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;banner&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"   \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"img\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"src\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;https://mimo.app/i/bug.png&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"alt\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;game title screen&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" /&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"   \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Space Runner\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"div\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Informative content located at the top of a page, similar to a <code>&lt;header&gt;</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">A normal paragraph</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Informative content located at the top of a page, similar to a <code>&lt;header&gt;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #12",
            "id": 149438,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>What <code>role</code> would you use to help screen readers consider different images a single element?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">The <code>img</code> role</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">The <code>images</code> role</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">The <code>img</code> role.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #13",
            "id": 149439,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>When should we use the <code>role</code> attribute?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Only when we cannot use the semantic HTML tag</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Whenever we want</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Only when we cannot use the semantic HTML tag.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #14",
            "id": 149440,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>What kind of information can we see in a <code>\"contentinfo\"</code> role?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Copyright, contact, or privacy info</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Comments and reactions</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Copyright, contact, or privacy info.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #15",
            "id": 149441,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Attach an <code>alert</code> role to the container to help screen readers identify this urgent information.</p><code name=\"index.html\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"38\" endIndex=\"42\" /><option startIndex=\"42\" endIndex=\"43\" /><option startIndex=\"43\" endIndex=\"50\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"&lt;!doctype html&gt;\" class=\"meta\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"div\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"role\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;alert&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Boss approaching! Prepare to fight.\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"div\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>role</code>, followed by <code>=</code>, and finally <code>\"alert\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #16",
            "id": 149442,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Code a <code>\"banner\"</code> role to have the <code>img</code> and the <code>h1</code> elements as the header of the page.</p><code name=\"index.html\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"44\" endIndex=\"50\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"&lt;!doctype html&gt;\" class=\"meta\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"div\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"role\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;banner&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"   \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"img\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"src\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;https://mimo.app/i/bug.png&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"alt\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;pixel hero&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"width\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;100px&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" /&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"   \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Pixel Quest\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"div\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to type <code>banner</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #17",
            "id": 149443,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>This page provides player feedback on levels. Include the <code>\"comment\"</code> role to help identify the feedback as a comment.</p><code name=\"index.html\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"140\" endIndex=\"144\" /><option startIndex=\"144\" endIndex=\"145\" /><option startIndex=\"145\" endIndex=\"154\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"&lt;!doctype html&gt;\" class=\"meta\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"img\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"src\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;https://mimo.app/i/bug.png&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"alt\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;game icon&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"   \" /><text value=\"width\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;150px&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" /&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Level Feedback\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"div\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"role\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;comment&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"   \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"h3\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"