=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">The role of the list shouldn't be \"contentinfo\"</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">The <code>li</code> element shouldn't be inside the <code>ul</code> element</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">The role of the list shouldn't be \"contentinfo\".</p></body></html>"
